# The palettes (docs/SCREENS.md 6.1, part s2cap): in E1M1, gamma through
# the menu (OPTIONS, DISPLAY & SOUND, GAMMA) at each step 0 to 4 and back
# to 0, the view and the status bar on screen after each change; then the
# tints by pokes of the player's fields at named tics (injected state with
# a reason: the pickups are not on E1M1's path): damagecount (the red
# tints), bonuscount (the gold), powers[pw_ironfeet] (the radiation suit's
# green), powers[pw_strength] (berserk's red), each left to run down.
#
# The player (offsets.inc): OFS_PL_POWERS 41 (6 words: IRONFEET 3,
# STRENGTH 1), OFS_PL_DAMAGECOUNT 117, OFS_PL_BONUSCOUNT 119. Menus:
# MAIN 0 (OPTIONS row 1), OPTIONS 6 (DISPLAY & SOUND row 1), VIDEO 12
# (GAMMA row 1): right raises gamma, left lowers it.

wait d_main65.s:pagedrawn == 1 within 90s   # the title page is up
at +1s press escape                     # a new game at the default skill
wait m_menu65.s:currentMenu == 0 within 10s
wait m_menu65.s:itemOn == 0 within 1
at +10f press return
wait m_menu65.s:currentMenu == 2 within 10s
wait m_menu65.s:itemOn == 2 within 1
at +10f press return
wait _g_usergame == 1 within 10s
wait _g_gamestate == 0 within 10s
wait long _g_gametic grows 1 within 60s # E1M1 is loaded
at +2s note level

at +10t press escape                    # gamma 1
wait m_menu65.s:currentMenu == 0 within 10s
wait m_menu65.s:itemOn == 0 within 10s
at +10f press down
wait m_menu65.s:itemOn == 1 within 10s
at +10f press return
wait m_menu65.s:currentMenu == 6 within 10s
wait m_menu65.s:itemOn == 0 within 10s
at +10f press down
wait m_menu65.s:itemOn == 1 within 10s
at +10f press return
wait m_menu65.s:currentMenu == 12 within 10s
wait m_menu65.s:itemOn == 0 within 10s
at +10f press down
wait m_menu65.s:itemOn == 1 within 10s
at +10f press right
wait m_menu65.s:_g_gamma == 1 within 10s
at +10f press escape
wait m_menu65.s:currentMenu == 6 within 10s
at +10f press escape
wait m_menu65.s:currentMenu == 0 within 10s
at +10f press escape
wait _g_menuactive == 0 within 10s

at +10t press escape                    # gamma 2
wait m_menu65.s:currentMenu == 0 within 10s
